file=Data & Analytics/viz/operational/principles/viz-principles.md · v·p:viz \· principles=> Universal-only (non-leader).\n\n1. **Chart type follows data shape, not preference.**\n2. **Colour is meaning; never decoration.** No red-green pairs.\n3. **WCAG AA is the ship-floor.** Blocker means blocked.\n4. **Every value has a delta.** Absolute-only is a defect.\n5. **Small multiples > overlaid** for > 3 series.\n6. **Alt-text is content**, not marketing.\n7. **Never auto-retire dashboards.** Owner sign-off required.\n8. **Metric drift blocks** ship of a dashboard on deprecated metric.\n9. **Provenance:** `[data source]` `[snapshot date]`.\n10. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n